### 3: the bank's services over MCP. Claude Code or MCP Inspector is nicer. These are the raw calls.
@host = http://localhost:8099

### M1. Initialize. Copy the Mcp-Session-Id response header into @session below.
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"intellij","version":"1.0"}}}

###
@session = paste-the-Mcp-Session-Id-here

### M2. Tell the server we are ready
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{session}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/initialized"}

### M3. List the tools (look for readOnlyHint)
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{session}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list"}

### M4. Open disputes over $500
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{session}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"findDisputes","arguments":{"status":"OPEN","minAmount":500}}}
